---
const name = "Analía Zárate";
const profileImgUrl = "/perfil.jpg";
---

<section id="sobre-mi" data-reveal="up" class="text-center md:text-left">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] md:items-center">
    <div class="md:col-start-2 md:row-start-1 md:pl-10">
      {/* Encabezado */}
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl md:mx-0">
        <div class="flex flex-nowrap items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-2 whitespace-nowrap">
          <p class="text-xs font-extrabold tracking-[0.14em] text-[#6D5EF7] uppercase">
            🧠 Sobre mí
          </p>
          <span class="h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-black/20"></span>
          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-[#6B6B6B]">Acompañamiento clínico</p>
        </div>

        <h2
          class="mt-4 font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#2E2E2E]
                 text-3xl leading-tight
                 sm:text-4xl"
        >
          Mi nombre es{" "}
          <span class="relative inline-block">
            <span class="relative z-10">{name}</span>
            <span
              class="absolute -bottom-1 left-0 right-0 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#FF7CC8]/40"
              aria-hidden="true"
            ></span>
          </span>
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-3">
          <span class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-[#6D5EF7]/15 ring-1 ring-black/5 lift"></span>
          <span class="text-xs text-[#6B6B6B]">Profesionalismo y responsabilidad ética</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Texto (exacto, sin repetir el nombre) */}
      <div class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl md:mx-0 space-y-6 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B6B6B] text-left sm:text-center md:text-left">
        <p data-reveal-item style="transition-delay: 120ms">
          soy psicóloga y ejerzo esta profesión con{" "}
          <span class="font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-extrabold text-[#2E2E2E]">
            profundo profesionalismo
          </span>
          ,{" "}
          <span class="font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-extrabold text-[#6D5EF7]">
            compromiso
          </span>{" "}
          y{" "}
          <span class="relative inline-block font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-extrabold text-[#6D5EF7]">
            <span class="relative z-10">responsabilidad ética</span>
            <span class="absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 right-0 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#FF7CC8]/30" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </span>
          .
        </p>

        <p data-reveal-item style="transition-delay: 240ms">
          Acompaño a personas en sus procesos personales desde una mirada{" "}
          <span class="font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-extrabold text-[#2E2E2E]">
            clínica
          </span>{" "}
          que prioriza la{" "}
          <span class="font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-extrabold text-[#6D5EF7]">
            subjetividad
          </span>
          , la{" "}
          <span class="font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-extrabold text-[#2E2E2E]">
            singularidad
          </span>{" "}
          y la{" "}
          <span class="relative inline-block font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-extrabold text-[#6D5EF7]">
            <span class="relative z-10">escucha atenta</span>
            <span class="absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 right-0 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#6D5EF7]/20" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </span>
          . Entiendo que cada historia es{" "}
          <span class="font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-extrabold text-[#FF4FB6]">
            única
          </span>
          , y que el trabajo terapéutico se construye respetando los{" "}
          <span class="font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-extrabold text-[#2E2E2E]">
            tiempos
          </span>{" "}
          y los{" "}
          <span class="font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-extrabold text-[#2E2E2E]">
            modos
          </span>{" "}
          de cada persona.
        </p>

        <div
          data-reveal-item
          style="transition-delay: 360ms"
          class="card-pro p-6 text-left sm:text-center md:text-left"
        >
          <p class="text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B6B6B]">
            Desde muy chica comencé a descubrir esta{" "}
            <span class="relative inline-block font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-extrabold text-[#6D5EF7]">
              <span class="relative z-10">vocación</span>
              <span class="absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 right-0 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#FF7CC8]/30" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </span>
            , en distintas situaciones de la vida cotidiana en las que me sentía convocada y dispuesta a{" "}
            <span class="font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-extrabold text-[#2E2E2E]">ayudar</span>{" "}
            a otros, a{" "}
            <span class="font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-extrabold text-[#2E2E2E]">escuchar</span>{" "}
            y a{" "}
            <span class="font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-extrabold text-[#2E2E2E]">acompañar</span>. Ese interés temprano fue dando forma a una elección que hoy se expresa en mi práctica clínica, que ejerzo con{" "}
            <span class="font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-extrabold text-[#FF4FB6]">pasión</span>{" "}
            y{" "}
            <span class="font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-extrabold text-[#6D5EF7]">compromiso</span>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Foto perfil */}
    <div class="mt-8 md:mt-0 md:col-start-1 md:row-start-1 md:justify-self-start md:self-center">
      <div
        class="relative inline-block w-[240px] sm:w-[280px] md:w-[320px] overflow-visible rounded-[14px] bg-white p-2
               shadow-[0_6px_18px_rgba(15,23,42,0.12),0_20px_50px_rgba(15,23,42,0.14)]
               [transform:rotate(var(--tilt))] transition-[transform,box-shadow] duration-[250ms] ease-out
               hover:[transform:translateY(-2px)_rotate(calc(var(--tilt)*0.4))]
               before:content-[''] before:absolute before:-top-3 before:left-8 before:h-6 before:w-24 before:rounded-[6px]
               before:bg-gradient-to-br before:from-white/70 before:to-white/30 before:border before:border-white/60
               before:shadow-[0_2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)] before:backdrop-blur-[2px] before:rotate-[-8deg]
               before:z-20 before:pointer-events-none
               after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-3 after:right-8 after:h-6 after:w-24 after:rounded-[6px]
               after:bg-gradient-to-br after:from-white/70 after:to-white/30 after:border after:border-white/60
               after:shadow-[0_2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)] after:backdrop-blur-[2px] after:rotate-[7deg]
               after:z-20 after:pointer-events-none
               tilt-l"
      >
        <img
          src={profileImgUrl}
          alt="Retrato de Analía Zárate"
          class="block w-full rounded-[12px]"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
